			"notes": "## What's New\n\n### New Features\n- Added decorative blocks to the game:\n  - Wool stairs, slabs, and vertical slabs\n  - Concrete stairs, slabs, and vertical slabs\n- Ported from Minecraft version 26.3\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- Fixed abnormal rendering at the corners of concrete stairs\n\n---\n\n## Credits\n| Role | Member |\n|------|--------|\n| Block Modeling / Testing / Promotion | Hana_jiang |\n| Technical Support | XMTG6666 |\n| Inspiration & Partial Block Modeling | modtong |"
